OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to book flu jabs as
OL,4,Arollout begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople eligible for a free flu jab in
OL,7,FDerbyshire and Nottinghamshire have
OL,8,Fbeen urged to book an appointment.
OL,10,FThe programme of vaccinations began on
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,13,FThose eligible for a free jab include
OL,14,Fthe over 65s, pregnant women, care home
OL,15,Fresidents and people classed
OL,16,Fclinically-vulnerable.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
