OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to book flu jabs as
OL,4,Arollout begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Clapton, assistant director of
OL,7,Fhealth protection for the area, said
OL,8,Fthe vaccine is "one of the best ways to
OL,9,Fprotect yourself, your family and those
OL,10,Faround you ahead as we move into the
OL,11,Fwinter months."
